<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- ENI named focus stock.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- ENI named focus stock.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it named Italian petroleum giant ENI SpA as its international focus stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage reiterated its buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
